@startuml HRMS_Sequence_Onboarding
title HRMS - Employee Onboarding Sequence

actor HR
participant "React Web" as UI
participant "Node.js API" as API
participant "Tenant Context / RLS" as RLS
database PostgreSQL as DB
queue "SQS" as SQS
participant "Background Worker" as Worker
participant "SES" as SES

HR -> UI: Create employee
UI -> API: POST /employees
API -> RLS: Resolve tenant_id
RLS -> DB: BEGIN + SET LOCAL app.tenant_id
API -> DB: Create employee + onboarding record
API -> DB: Insert audit event
API -> DB: Insert outbox event
DB --> API: Commit
API --> UI: 201 Created

Worker -> SQS: Consume EmployeeCreated
SQS --> Worker: Event {tenant_id,event_id,...}
Worker -> RLS: Establish tenant context
Worker -> DB: Load onboarding tasks
Worker -> DB: Create notification jobs
Worker -> SES: Send onboarding email
SES --> Worker: Delivery accepted
Worker -> DB: Mark notification processed
Worker -> SQS: Ack message

note over API,DB
Every tenant-owned transaction must establish
transaction-local tenant context before queries.
end note

@enduml
